## RDS — SSL / sslmode

Always use `sslmode=no-verify` — RDS requires SSL (`disable` is rejected by `pg_hba.conf`).
Do **not** use `sslmode=require` without ensuring ICMP type 3/code 4 is allowed in all NACLs
(PMTUD failures cause SSL handshake timeouts when TLS cert packets exceed the path MTU).

