## Amplify — Key Rules

- **Never** update env vars without reading the current full set first — partial writes wipe existing vars.
- **Never** hardcode `--profile napx` in CI/CD scripts — the pipeline IAM role handles auth automatically.
- Trigger a manual redeploy after any env var change so the Lambda cold-starts with the new values.

